  "bio": "Clémence L’Encrière, renowned for their exceptional fineline tattoo artistry, operates in trouville-sur-mer, France. Each design by Clémence showcases a high level of professionalism, reflecting both precision and passion for the craft. Anyone seeking an intricately detailed and expertly executed tattoo will find Clémence's work to be exemplary and their experience at the studio to be both comfortable and hygienic.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Trouville-sur-mer, Normandy, France"
